bg=blue</panel_attributes><additional_attributes></additional_attributes></element><element><id>UMLNote</id><coordinates><x>320</x><y>0</y><w>240</w><h>104</h></coordinates><panel_attributes>getIndicator is computed as the indicator 
of the most recent tracking log for this claim. 
It obtains a ClaimRepository bean, queries 
the published tracking logs for the claim with 
the false flag, selects the log with the greatest 
orderDate, and returns its indicator. 
If no log is found, it returns ClaimStatus.PENDING.
bg=white</panel_attributes><additional_attributes></additional_attributes></element><element><id>Relation</id><coordinates><x>440</x><y>96</y><w>24</w><h>56</h></coordinates><panel_attributes></panel_attributes><additional_attributes>10;50;10;10</additional_attributes></element><element><id>UMLClass</id><coordinates><x>312</x><y>368</y><w>480</w><h>136</h></coordinates><panel_attributes>&lt;&lt;Entity&gt;&gt;
